+/**
+ * baguette `/simulators/<udid>/stream?format=avcc|mjpeg` WebSocket. One binary
+ * message per frame: `[tag][payload]` for AVCC (0x01 config, 0x02 key,
+ * 0x03 delta, 0x04 JPEG seed); MJPEG messages are bare JPEGs.
